{"watch":5,"start":1200,"events":[{"seq":164,"t":1200,"type":"watch","watch":5},{"seq":165,"t":1200,"type":"model","house":"rhino","model":"local:local","tokens":1625,"retries":0},{"seq":166,"t":1200,"type":"thought","house":"rhino","text":"Rhino has forces near F1 and F2. Kite is at F2 (n-mid), Orchid is at F1 (s-west). I need to secure fords and hunt enemy riders. I'll use my cavalry to pressure Kite's position at n-mid and send scouts to F3."},{"seq":167,"t":1200,"type":"courier","id":"c61","house":"rhino","letter":"L79","kind":"order","to":"rhino-cav-1","path":["rhino-camp","n-west"],"depart":1200,"plain":"HORSE, MARCH TO NORTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":null},{"seq":168,"t":1200,"type":"courier","id":"c62","house":"rhino","letter":"L80","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-1","path":["rhino-camp","n-west"],"depart":1200,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":169,"t":1200,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1614,"retries":0},{"seq":170,"t":1200,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"My forces are near the center. Rhino archers are at North Village. I should try to secure F2 and F3. My doctrine suggests making a friend. I will try to offer a truce to the Orchid house first, as they are somewhat isolated."},{"seq":171,"t":1200,"type":"courier","id":"c63","house":"kite","letter":"L81","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid"],"depart":1200,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO NORTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":null},{"seq":172,"t":1200,"type":"courier","id":"c64","house":"kite","letter":"L82","kind":"order","to":"kite-cav-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid"],"depart":1200,"plain":"HORSE, SCOUT NORTH BANK WEST.","cipher":null},{"seq":173,"t":1200,"type":"courier","id":"c65","house":"kite","letter":"L83","kind":"letter","to":"orchid-camp","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid","F2","s-mid","south-village","orchid-camp"],"depart":1200,"plain":"TRUCE","cipher":null},{"seq":174,"t":1200,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1668,"retries":0},{"seq":175,"t":1200,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"Rhino is strong at W Ford (F1). I need to secure F1 or F2. My infantry/cavalry are at F1/SW Bank. I'll reinforce F1 with my archers and elephants to secure it, while using scouts/cavalry to harass Rhino's riders near F1/F2, adhering to doctrine."},{"seq":176,"t":1200,"type":"courier","id":"c66","house":"orchid","letter":"L84","kind":"order","to":"orchid-arch-1","path":["orchid-camp"],"depart":1200,"plain":"BOWMEN, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":177,"t":1200,"type":"courier","id":"c67","house":"orchid","letter":"L85","kind":"order","to":"orchid-ele-1","path":["orchid-camp"],"depart":1200,"plain":"ELEPHANTS, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":178,"t":1200,"type":"model","house":"tiger","model":"local:local","tokens":1606,"retries":0},{"seq":179,"t":1200,"type":"thought","house":"tiger","text":"No intelligence; must establish presence and probe. Tiger units are clustered near southern camps. I will move inf/arch to secure F2 and F3 approaches, and send out scouts to find any enemy movement."},{"seq":180,"t":1200,"type":"courier","id":"c68","house":"tiger","letter":"L86","kind":"order","to":"tiger-inf-1","path":["tiger-camp","south-village"],"depart":1200,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO SOUTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":null},{"seq":181,"t":1200,"type":"courier","id":"c69","house":"tiger","letter":"L87","kind":"order","to":"tiger-inf-2","path":["tiger-camp","south-village","s-mid"],"depart":1200,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, MARCH TO SOUTH BANK EAST.","cipher":null},{"seq":182,"t":1200,"type":"courier","id":"c70","house":"tiger","letter":"L88","kind":"order","to":"tiger-arch-1","path":["tiger-camp","south-village","s-mid"],"depart":1200,"plain":"BOWMEN, MARCH TO SOUTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":null},{"seq":183,"t":1200,"type":"delivered","courier":"c58","letter":"L76","house":"orchid"},{"seq":184,"t":1200,"type":"delivered","courier